hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15576","Ibrahim ibn Abi al-Abbas narrated to us: Baqiyyah narrated to us: Bahir ibn Sad narrated to us, from Khalid ibn Madan, from some of the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw a man praying with a spot on the back of his foot the size of a dirham which water had not touched. So the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) ordered him to repeat the wudu."
